{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1267008-quick-lunar-illustrations","id":1267008,"title":"Quick Lunar illustrations","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Lunar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-11-13T10:56:49-08:00","id":1267008,"title":"Quick Lunar illustrations","content":"Hi everyone,<br /> <br /> I've been away for some time. <br /> <br /> I'm a bit bored and with some time to spare. If any of you guys have an interesting lunar exalted concept I'll make a quick sketch and share it here.<br /> <br /> I'll gravitate towards the ones that catch my interest the most, but I'll try to cover many of your suggestions.<br /> <br /> Ready?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"934"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-13T11:27:22-08:00","id":1267027,"title":"","content":"I had a No Moon NPC, a giraffe totem who wears neck rings in a manner reminicent of women of the Kayan tribe of Myanmar to hide his tell of a long neck and in my mind he's aesthetically something between that and Zulu.<br /> <br /> Seemed like something you might be able to have fun with. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-13T11:35:23-08:00","id":1267031,"title":"","content":"I'm playing Dr Soma, a female Indian (or Burmese)-looking doctor (late 20s) with snake fangs. And, you know, she can turn into a scaly snake-woman, of course.<br /> <br /> I'm not quite sure what she'd look like in terms of being a doctor though. I know what medieval European doctors might look like, but not Indian ones. Maybe you can think of something interesting with that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":2402,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","user":"The Wizard of Oz","date":". 11-13-2018, 02:38 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-13T13:26:55-08:00","id":1267068,"title":"","content":"<img src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/intermediary/f/3b96d9f9-66de-47de-9647-866be86fc670/dcrwxmn-02ee2011-46a8-4e0e-b465-a6a8662d9927.jpg/v1/fill/w_774,h_1032,q_70,strp/snake_woman_by_bersagliere_dcrwxmn-pre.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>Snake woman is always interesting to try.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":16}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"934"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-13T14:02:04-08:00","id":1267084,"title":"","content":"Ooooo, nifty! Might as well toss my own hat into the ring! Silence is a Full-Moon whose spirit shape is a mantis. Formerly a child soldier, he and his comrades deserted and tried to escape to safety but were intercepted by a Wyld Hunt with intel that they were harboring a Lunar among their number. He wound up Exalting in the ensuing battle; someone up in the Bronze Faction got a real earful because dammit you guys, we JUST had that seminar on self-fulfilling prophecies last week! With charts and everything!<br /> <br /> In human form, he's small and slightly-built, but all muscle. He has bronze-colored skin and leaf-green hair, with two antennae poking up from his brow as his Tell. In War Form, he's a ten-foot whirlwind of scything death, with one upper pair of forelimbs that end in serrated sickles like twin daiklaves and one lower pair with more human-looking hands for fine manipulation or martial arts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1024-thesaurasaurus","name":"Thesaurasaurus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-13T14:11:15-08:00","id":1267088,"title":"","content":"Sweet snake-woman form illustration. Too bad my favorite Lunar I've played is also a snake totem; I feel derivative ^^","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1096-squidheadjax","name":"squidheadjax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1096_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-13T14:51:36-08:00","id":1267094,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gonzo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1267008-quick-lunar-illustrations?p=1267068#post1267068\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Snake woman is always interesting to try.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's pretty damn freaky.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-14T12:03:05-08:00","id":1267375,"title":"","content":"I have an old Lunar I am fond of. Thousand-Hands Sati, a scary centipede-Lunar who is blind after having her eyes cut out and (in human form) bald with blue skin.<br /> <br /> Alternately, I briefly played a leopard seal lunar who is just a chubby friendly smiling ball of fun and murder, who let me play with Inuit and Siberian inspired cold weather fashion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-14T12:18:29-08:00","id":1267379,"title":"","content":"<img src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/intermediary/f/3b96d9f9-66de-47de-9647-866be86fc670/dcrzer3-b83ddaf5-3df5-4b12-bc45-5a3b250cd102.jpg/v1/fill/w_600,h_800,q_70,strp/giraffe_sage_by_bersagliere_dcrzer3-fullview.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> I'm not an expert on Zulu clothes, but here's my humble interpretation of how a giraffe lunar could look like.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":90,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","user":"Gonzo","date":". 12-06-2018, 04:56 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":18}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"934"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-16T09:12:26-08:00","id":1267869,"title":"","content":"Oh he's magnificent, thank you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-16T09:21:39-08:00","id":1267873,"title":"","content":"I did not expect a Giraffe Lunar to look like that, but it's great.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-16T10:10:33-08:00","id":1267896,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1267008-quick-lunar-illustrations?p=1267869#post1267869\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh he's magnificent, thank you.</div> </div> </div> </div>This concept was very challenging.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"934"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-16T18:53:43-08:00","id":1268117,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wise Old Guru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1267008-quick-lunar-illustrations?p=1267375#post1267375\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have an old Lunar I am fond of. Thousand-Hands Sati, a scary centipede-Lunar who is blind after having her eyes cut out and (in human form) bald with blue skin.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm actually curious to see how Sati turns out as well. Great character concept.<br /> From the same game, Far-Reaching Echo (my character) was a desert-monitor Lunar who mostly just used her tail as a third arm for sword lunges. She was also working alongside the Shogunate at the time as a desert soldier to patrol the Southern lands for raksha (looooong story), so initial conception would be her in a desert-style genzosha armor. Was probably three or four sessions away from either leaving the Shogunate forces, or getting killed, but she was still friends with her old squadmates.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I used to know things. Forbidden things.</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/306-brasstreader","name":"Brasstreader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar306_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-17T08:17:04-08:00","id":1268279,"title":"","content":"I've got an NPC Lunar in the works. She's a rabbit totem scholar, whose primary effort is in writing subversive literature attacking the Realm and Immaculate philosophy. She has several pen-names variously for critical essays, parody plays, and ribald etchings. She usually tries to escape combat, but if she's cornered, she whips out a double-barreled sawn-off firewand, in the hopes that a surprise counterattack will give her enough time to escape. <br /> <br /> So basically a tubby rabbit with a shotgun, in a flurry of upturned papers. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1188890-momentum-exalted\" target=\"_blank\">Momentum Exalted!</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6192-simon-darkstep","name":"Simon Darkstep","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-20T13:45:13-08:00","id":1269336,"title":"","content":"<img src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/intermediary/f/3b96d9f9-66de-47de-9647-866be86fc670/dcshaes-fc7ea064-eb58-449f-8dfd-70df53f3e740.jpg/v1/fill/w_600,h_800,q_70,strp/centepede_man_by_bersagliere_dcshaes-fullview.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> Dunno if he owns a canoe... I think he should...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":14}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"934"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-20T14:02:32-08:00","id":1269345,"title":"","content":"<img src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/intermediary/f/3b96d9f9-66de-47de-9647-866be86fc670/dcshc3r-12671ca0-c999-4694-8e71-ecbf01273f0a.jpg/v1/fill/w_600,h_800,q_70,strp/bunny_by_bersagliere_dcshc3r-fullview.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> History is written by the bunnies.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":16}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"934"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-21T06:47:32-08:00","id":1269547,"title":"","content":"Love these so much.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1920-kim","name":"Kim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-21T10:52:23-08:00","id":1269616,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gonzo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1267008-quick-lunar-illustrations?p=1269345#post1269345\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><img src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/intermediary/f/3b96d9f9-66de-47de-9647-866be86fc670/dcshc3r-12671ca0-c999-4694-8e71-ecbf01273f0a.jpg/v1/fill/w_600,h_800,q_70,strp/bunny_by_bersagliere_dcshc3r-fullview.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> History is written by the bunnies.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fantastic!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1188890-momentum-exalted\" target=\"_blank\">Momentum Exalted!</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6192-simon-darkstep","name":"Simon Darkstep","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-21T11:53:28-08:00","id":1269636,"title":"","content":"<img src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/intermediary/f/3b96d9f9-66de-47de-9647-866be86fc670/dcsjtu8-144c708b-beba-4cf9-a2da-0d43916c2fbc.jpg/v1/fill/w_600,h_800,q_70,strp/fae_eater_by_bersagliere_dcsjtu8-fullview.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> I imagined her lost in the desert and surviving on a Wyld fae hive... or something.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"934"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-22T09:20:36-08:00","id":1269845,"title":"","content":"Man, these are delightful! Sati looks great! Your design is definitely going to get incorporated into my <br /> future drawings of her!Thanks!<br /> <br /> Also, that bunny's aura, expression, stance... everything about that image is perfectly emanating &quot;Do not attempt to mess with me,&quot; and I love it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-22T09:59:17-08:00","id":1269854,"title":"","content":"...You know what I want to see?<br /> <br /> I want to see if you can make a chicken scary.<br /> <br /> Richard Wilhelm, Herald of the Day of Glory. Full Moon Lunar. Totem: Rooster. A giant brawler whose tells are a beard and humongous pompadour of brilliant red hair, or whatever is appropriate for the form. When things get serious, he brings out the grand goremaul Striker.<br /> <br /> The naughty jokes are strong with this one.<br /> <br /> Edit: For reference:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tn5FPfZ9h0U\" data-code=\"tn5FPfZ9h0U\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/tn5FPfZ9h0U/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> Edit2: I just noticed that the rooster in this vid is probably a capon rather than a fully murderous cockerel, but you get the idea.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":175,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","user":"Prometheus878","date":". 11-22-2018, 01:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-22T10:35:12-08:00","id":1269861,"title":"","content":"<img src=\"https://vignette.wikia.nocookie.net/imagecomics/images/a/af/Poyo_Chew_001.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150201143535\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/> Cock-fights. Cockerels are trained to be ruthless gladiatorial killing machines.<br /> <br /> I used to have two hens, and they are vicious. We once saved a mouse from my cat and put it in the chicken's fenced-off area to keep it safe from her... the chickens went straight for it and pecked it to death.<br /> <br /> When you saw them walking with their beady vicious eyes... you can see they're descended from dinosaurs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-22T10:49:33-08:00","id":1269866,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1267008-quick-lunar-illustrations?p=1269861#post1269861\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><img src=\"https://vignette.wikia.nocookie.net/imagecomics/images/a/af/Poyo_Chew_001.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150201143535\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/> Cock-fights. Cockerels are trained to be ruthless gladiatorial killing machines.<br /> <br /> I used to have two hens, and they are vicious. We once saved a mouse from my cat and put it in the chicken's fenced-off area to keep it safe from her... the chickens went straight for it and pecked it to death.<br /> <br /> When you saw them walking with their beady vicious eyes... you can see they're descended from dinosaurs.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yup! I almost forgot about that. Richard is, naturally, a vicious pit-fighter.<br /> <br /> It's gonna get bloody.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":175,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","user":"Prometheus878","date":". 11-22-2018, 01:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-23T07:17:45-08:00","id":1270105,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gonzo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1267008-quick-lunar-illustrations?p=1269636#post