rawler whose tells are a beard and humongous pompadour of brilliant red hair, or whatever is appropriate for the form. When things get serious, he brings out the grand goremaul Striker.<br /> <br /> The naughty jokes are strong with this one.</div> </div> </div> </div>Brawl...... but with a goremaul?<br /> Both.<br /> Both is good.<br /> Although with that video, you're missig out on some clawed-toe God Kicking Boots. Good Moon, those drumsticks and thighs. Like a freaking T-Rex.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I used to know things. Forbidden things.</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/306-brasstreader","name":"Brasstreader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar306_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-25T21:12:21-08:00","id":1270761,"title":"","content":"The chicken in the video is scary, and majestic. Those furry fetlock are fascinating.....<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prometheus878</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1267008-quick-lunar-illustrations?p=1269854#post1269854\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...You know what I want to see?<br /> <br /> I want to see if you can make a chicken scary.<br /> <br /> Richard Wilhelm, Herald of the Day of Glory. Full Moon Lunar. Totem: Rooster. A giant brawler whose tells are a beard and humongous pompadour of brilliant red hair, or whatever is a